{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-command-setting",
  "version": "0.8.4",
  "description": "dsh web 命令设置：从 “+” / “/” 命令菜单中隐藏/显示指定 slash 命令（默认 export/feedback/permission），在设置页新增「命令设置」区，支持隐藏/显示/新增；并外置 plan/ask 模式切换按钮（点击调用 /plan、/ask——ask 为会话级只问答模式：禁改/禁建文件，机械拦截 + 提示约束）；composer 内以 # 引用历史会话（跨工作区、未归档、主代理）；消息文本划词浮出「引用」按钮，一键把选中内容作为引用块追加进 composer。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": false
    }
  },
  "repository": "WensH77/dsh-plugins#path:command-setting",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.mjs && node test/client-smoke.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.1.5-alpha.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-commands": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace": "*"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": {
